    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491410/extras/71f11d2e2bde6805c2bc5d907689137e.avif?t=1741313286\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span><br><br>Get on board your tofas \u200b\u200band play alone, with strangers or with friends in this little game full of surprises!<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br>\ud83d\uded1 Tofas!<br>\ud83d\uded1 Deliver kebabs and earn money!<br>\ud83d\uded1 Drive a taxi and earn money!<br>\ud83d\uded1 Customize your car!<br>\ud83d\uded1 Drive on the legendary Istanbul circuit and set your best time!<br>\ud83d\uded1 Play tag with your friends or other players!<br>\ud83d\uded1 Compete against other players on the circuit!<br>\ud83d\uded1 A global ranking is available to see who is the best!<br>\ud83d\uded1 A proximity voice chat is available for more interactions with other players!<br>\ud83d\uded1 Try to finish the stunt map in record time!<br>\ud83d\uded1 Get all the achievements!<br>\ud83d\uded1 Discover all the secrets!<br><br><i>Tofas Simulator is a small game that we made without pretensions in our free time.</i>",
